The files in this directory are a small subset of STScI's public Tools Reference Data System (TRDS) spectral library, intended for 
use with the STSynphot package.
For more details about TRDS:
https://www.stsci.edu/hst/instrumentation/reference-data-for-calibration-and-tools/astronomical-catalogs
The full archive can be found here:
https://archive.stsci.edu/hlsp/reference-atlases

It is intended that this directory be set as the environment variable $PYSYN_CDBS.
SYOTools will also function with a complete TRDS library.

Last update of grid-table files: 2026-09-23

